    "name"
   ],
   "1. Solitary Bees",
   "一、独居蜜蜂"
  ],
  [
   [
    "pages",
    0,
    "text"
   ],
   "Solitary bees can be found spawning from solitary nests in the overworld. Nests are generated during world gen or can be crafted and placed in the world manually. Each nest will spawn it's own variety of solitary bees and some of them need to be placed in specific biomes. Most solitary bees will not live in hives and do not produce any combs, but they have useful genetics for breeding.",
   "独居蜜蜂会从主世界的独居蜂巢中生成。蜂巢在世界生成时出现，也可以合成后自己放置。每种蜂巢生成各自的独居蜜蜂，有些还必须放在特定生物群系里。多数独居蜜蜂不住蜂箱、也不产蜜脾，但它们的基因在繁殖时很有用。"
  ],
  [
   [
    "pages",
    1,
    "text"
   ],
   "Empty nests will attract a solitary bee after a while as long as the nest is in the correct biome and loaded. Some solitary bees only spawn from the nest of other solitary bees, these are called Cuckoo bees.",
   "只要蜂巢放在正确的生物群系里并处于加载状态，空蜂巢过一阵就会引来独居蜜蜂。有些独居蜜蜂只会从其他独居蜜蜂的蜂巢里生成，这类叫杜鹃蜂。"
  ],
